@startuml Connix Use Cases - Level 2
title Use Cases - Level 2

package "Use Cases" {
  [Configuration use case] as configuration
  [Execution scheduler] as scheduler
  [Connection-cycle use case] as cycle
  [Event and rule use case] as rules
  [Observation use case] as observation
}

interface "Configuration port" as configuration_port
interface "Protocol port" as protocol_port
interface "Output port" as output_port

configuration --> configuration_port
cycle --> protocol_port
observation --> output_port

configuration --> scheduler
scheduler --> cycle
cycle --> rules
rules --> observation

note right of configuration
  Applies parser selection,
  precedence, and invariants.
end note
note right of scheduler
  ONETIME/PERIODIC triggers,
  no overlap, DUAL isolation.
end note
note right of cycle
  CLIENT, SERVER, and DUAL
  connection lifecycles/timeouts.
end note
note right of rules
  Event matching and scoped
  rule actions.
end note
note right of observation
  Sent, received, and diagnostic
  output events.
end note

@enduml
